<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8687" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνθαιρ-έομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>choose</i> one person or thing <i>instead of</i>
			another, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ δ᾽ εὐσεβὲς τῆς δυσσεβείας ἀνθελοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Cyc.</u>
					311
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλλους ἀ. ἀντὶ τούτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>CIG</u>
					2715.11
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Stratonicea</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρατηγοὺς ἔπαυσαν . . καὶ ἄλλους
					ἀνθείλοντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					6.103
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				6.2.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				765d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰν εὔδοξον ἀ. φήμαν</span>”
				<i>prefer, choose rather,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hipp.</u>
					773
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>dispute, lay claim to,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδεὶς στέφανον ἀνθαιρήσεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Hec.</u>
					660
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
